  "settingsFaqDialogTitle": "Frequently asked questions",
  "settingsFaqQ1": "What's included in the Free plan?",
  "settingsFaqA1": "無料プランでは短編ドラマの閲覧、お気に入り保存、標準画質での視聴ができます。Proにアップグレードすると、広告なし視聴、オフライン保存、VIP限定シリーズが利用できます。",
  "settingsFaqQ2": "What does Pro include?",
  "settingsFaqA2": "Proでは広告なし視聴、エピソードのオフライン保存、VIP限定シリーズ、高画質ストリーミング、無制限のマイリストが解放されます。",
  "settingsFaqQ3": "Can I download podcasts for offline listening?",
  "settingsFaqA3": "Yes. Pro subscribers can download podcast episodes for offline listening on Wi‑Fi or mobile data, depending on your settings.",
  "settingsFaqQ4": "Can I listen to live radio worldwide?",
  "settingsFaqA4": "Yes. Browse 100,000+ live radio stations by genre, country, and language. Save presets and jump back to your favorites anytime.",
  "settingsFaqQ5": "What audio quality is available?",
  "settingsFaqA5": "Free users get standard streaming quality. Pro includes high-quality streams for supported stations and podcasts.",
  "settingsFaqQ6": "Can I cancel anytime?",
  "settingsFaqA6": "Yes. You can cancel your subscription whenever you want. You'll keep Pro access until the end of your current billing period.",
  "settingsFaqQ7": "Do you offer refunds?",
  "settingsFaqA7": "If you run into an issue, contact us and we'll help. Refund eligibility can vary depending on usage and billing; we'll review requests case-by-case.",
  "settingsFaqQ8": "Can I switch plans later?",
  "settingsFaqA8": "Yes. You can upgrade or downgrade at any time. Changes take effect immediately or at the next billing cycle depending on the plan change.",
  "settingsFaqQ9": "How do podcast subscriptions work?",
  "settingsFaqA9": "Subscribe to any podcast in one tap. New episodes appear in your library, and you can resume playback exactly where you left off.",
  "settingsFaqQ10": "How do playlists and presets work?",
  "settingsFaqA10": "Save radio stations as presets, build playlists, and keep your listening history synced across sessions so you can continue where you stopped.",
  "settingsFaqQ11": "Which content is Pro-only?",
  "settingsFaqA11": "一部のVIP限定シリーズ、オフライン保存、広告なし視聴、高画質ストリーミングにはProが必要です。無料ユーザーもほとんどのドラマとエピソードを楽しめます。",
  "proBudgetHelpTitle": "Proの仕組み",
  "proBudgetHelpBullet1": "Proはエピソード再生中の広告を削除し、プレミアムドラマ機能を解放します。",
  "proBudgetHelpBullet2": "マイリスト、お気に入り、視聴履歴はアプリ内で同期されます。",
